| Q2_K_P | 3 | 3351.29 | 213.95 | 145.09 | +11.6% / +1.7% | 2.27x / 1.48x |
| Q3_K_P | 3 | 3317.16 | 216.15 | 137.99 | +20.5% / +8.8% | 2.54x / 1.56x |
